Z||000004||RossT||06-19-2001||04:03 AM||||There is a guy (don't have link) that makes aftermarket ones with the sunshade bag.  He has a variety of colors to match you interior.  His price is also very resonable. <BR>You can see his on e-bay from time to time, but he also sells them off e-bay.<P>OEM ones used to go for ALOT of money, but recently the prices have come down.  I have a NOS grey one that I am holding on too.  Now if I can only find a sunroof car to buy!!||||reg||1
